    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορμο-λύττομαι</span></b> , only pres. and
			impf. (exc. aor. 1
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορμολυξάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.106
				</span></i>
			): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορμώ</span>):—<i>frighten,
				scare</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1245
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				46c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.468
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fear, be afraid of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					364b
				</span></i>
			.—
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορμολύττω</span> is f. l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
